# ${PROJECT_NAME} — AI workspace

The AI workspace half of a dual-repo project. Paired with canonical at `${CANONICAL_ROOT}`.

## What this repo holds

- Memory bank, MASTER-SPEC, sprint specs, brainstorm artifacts, process ADRs — everything an agentic IDE needs to understand the project.
- `.workspace/pairing.json` — the pairing manifest (workspace-init wrote this; downstream plugins read it).

## What this repo does NOT hold

Production code, product docs (PRD/SRS/BACKLOG), product ADRs, test code. Those live in canonical (`${CANONICAL_ROOT}`).

## Cadence

- AI workspace: commit cadence is per-sprint or per-big-milestone (bundled).
- Canonical: per-feature / per-slice / per-bug-fix commits.

## Plugins involved

- `workspace-init` (this plugin) — bootstrapped both repos.
- `scaffold-onboard` — runs next; authors MASTER-SPEC, memory-bank, PRD/SRS in canonical.
- `scaffold-dev` — authors sprint specs after onboarding.
- `architect-critic` — fresh-frame adversarial review of specs.
- `ai-mentor` — decision-making aids.

See the marketplace README at the marketplace root for plugin details.
